    "identifier": "flying-swallow-cross",
    "description": "<p>As a part of the activation of this jutsu, you must have a different weapon in each hand that would qualify you for dual wielding. You make swinging cuts in a single stoke by swinging both of your weapons inward.</p>\n<p>Make two Taijutsu attacks, each can be vs a different enemy. On a hit, you deal [Weapons damage] + 1d10</p>\n<p>Chain 1: The target must make a strength saving throw to avoid being disarmed of their weapon or item they are holding.    At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d4.</p>",
